  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program 2026-2028 South Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development goal: 
The livelihoods and social cohesion of the communities in Kapoeta East County have improved.
Objectives: 
1. The livelihoods of the target communities are enhanced.
2. The peaceful coexistence of the target communities is enhanced.
Indicators: 
1.1. At least 500 (150 male) households have reduced their food shortage months from four months to zero months.
1.2. At least 400 (250 female) people engaged in alternative livelihoods activities have improved their income by at least 50% (from x SSP to x SSP).
2.1 Violent conflicts related to competition over resources, cattle raiding and ethnic difference reduced from X cases to Y in the target Payams.</narrative>
  </description>
